      "reasons": [
        "The packet states the study used a 27-item self-report instrument “adapted from the Watson-Glaser Critical Thinking Appraisal,” but it does not define what the Watson–Glaser critical thinking appraisal measures (e.g., “critical thinking” as an evaluation target) or describe it as “a named assessment used to evaluate critical thinking.”",
        "Because the packet does not explicitly support the claim about the appraisal’s purpose/sense (“used to evaluate critical thinking”), the overall definition contains an unsupported substantive characterization."
